Info on open source PWR model CAD Data Files:

- Files are provided in two formats: STEP (.step) and Parasolid binary (.x_b)
- The files RV_solid.* are the CAD for the solid components of the reactor vessel, excluding the fuel assemblies
- The files FAs.* are CAD block representations of the fuel assemblies (one CAD body per FA), which can be used to construct porous media represntations of the FAs
- Note that detailed CAD for the fuel assemblies is not available at this time
